-- Cryomancer rework (Q 2026-10-25, design/cryo-research-2026-10-25.md): Shatter on the first clean hit on a Frozen enemy,
-- Thaw (no Freeze again for a while), Flash Freeze draw, Frost Armor regrows on Block. Text only; numbers stay in params.
update champion_styles set effect =
'Frost Armor: start the game with Shield {frostArmorShield}. Every turn you Block, it regrows {frostArmorRegen} Shield (up to {frostArmorCap}). Every hit a Shield soaks gives the attacker 1 Chill. ⟡ Infuse: every Skill card you paid for gives the opponent {MG.infusePerS} Chill, even when it is Blocked. Chill: each stack makes that side''s hits deal {chillDmgCut}% less ({chillTurns} turns, max {chillMax}). At {chillMax} stacks the opponent is Frozen: Chill clears and they can''t Strike next turn. Flash Freeze: when you Freeze them, draw {freezeDraw} cards at the end of the turn. Shatter: your first clean hit on a Frozen opponent takes {shatterPct}% of their Max HP (their Block stops it). Thaw: after Frozen ends they can''t be Frozen again for {thawTurns} turns. Frozen Tomb (once a game): when you drop below {tombHpPct}% HP (the red bar), or would be knocked out (you stay on 1 HP), you are sealed in ice: Frost Armor''s Shield {frostArmorShield} comes back and next turn you can only Block. At the end of that turn heal {tombHeal} + {tombHealPerMana} per Mana (all your Mana is spent). The turn after, {tombMeltPct}% of the Shield you have left turns into HP. Absolute Zero (S + S + S all clean): the opponent is Frozen and can''t Block next turn.'
where champion_id = 'MG' and slot = 2;
